python3-pyliblo (python wrapper for the liblo OSC library)

python3-pyliblo is a Python wrapper for the liblo Open Sound Control
library. It supports almost the complete functionality of liblo,
allowing you to send and receive OSC messages using a nice and simple
Python API.

This build includes support for Python 3. Also included are the
command line utilities send_osc and dump_osc. If you need
Python 2 support, see python2-pyliblo.
